  Slug: fey-friend
  DisplayName: Fey Friend
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "Many grow up hearing cautionary tales of mischievous fey, and with
    good reason: from sprites' pranks to gremlins' sabotage to redcaps' outright
    lethality, fey pose a real danger to the unwary. But not for you\u2014usually!
    Whether you grew up near an enchanted wilderness, have visited the First World,
    frequently deal with nature spirits, or even were a fey foundling raised by otherworldly
    beings, you're well acquainted with fey, their myriad traditions, and their even
    more numerous tricks. Fey and the Wildwood Lodge aren't the same thing, yet there's
    enough overlap that you're sure to fit in at the upcoming Greenwood Gala. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Charisma or Dexterity , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Deception skill and the Fey Lore skill.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Charming Liar] skill feat."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Wardens of Wildwood Player's Guide
